    <section class="d-none card"><div class="card-body">
The results of the Advanced Jack&Jill prelim during Asia WCS Open  2026 in  Singapore at 04/16/2026.<br />
<br />
Judges in this round were Jérôme Fernandez, Alexis Garrish, Charles Brown, Maxence Martin, Charles Brown, Dalena Lee, Richard Chung, Skylar Pritchard, Aymeline Felmy-Martin, Igor Pitangui, John-Paul Masson and Fernanda Dubiel.    </div></section>

